### ============================================================
### Auth — login / profile / logout
### Seeded users: admin@wiralab.com | budi@wiralab.com (password)
### After login, token disimpan ke global `token` (kulala).
### Pilih environment `dev` di kulala sebelum request.
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}

### Login as admin sistem
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}",
  "device_name": "kulala"
}

> {%
client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### Login as laboran
# @name loginLaboran
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{laboranEmail}}",
  "password": "{{laboranPassword}}",
  "device_name": "kulala-laboran"
}

> {%
client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### Login as kepala lab
# @name loginKepalaLab
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{kepalaLabEmail}}",
  "password": "{{kepalaLabPassword}}",
