### Login as peminjam
# @name loginStaff
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{staffEmail}}",
  "password": "{{staffPassword}}",
  "device_name": "kulala-peminjam"
}

> {%
client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### Login — invalid password (expect 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "salah",
  "device_name": "kulala"
}

### Get current authenticated user
GET {{baseUrl}}/user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Logout (revokes current token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
